 ############################### Xtellcor History ##############################                                                                                HISTORY This spectrum was telluric corrected using the telluric correction      HISTORY spectra xtellcor_220481411_tellspec.fits.  The velocity shift of Vega   HISTORY is 18.0889 km s-1.  The Vega model was modified using the               HISTORY deconvolution method.  The maximum deviation and rms deviation          HISTORY between the modified Vega model and the data over the kernel            HISTORY wavelength range are 2.81593% and 1.04851%, respectively.  The          HISTORY telluric correction spectra for aperture 01 were shifted by 1.89041,    HISTORY 1.86761, 1.87323, 1.98861, 2.10372, 2.13718, 1.50000 pixels.                                                                                             ############################# Xmergeorders History ############################                                                                                HISTORY This merged spectrum was derived from aperture 01 of file               HISTORY xtellcor_220481411.fits.  The scaled factors for orders 3, 4, 5, 6,     HISTORY 7, 8, 9 are 1.00000, 1.12934, 1.16116, 1.19485, 1.21602, 1.23289,       HISTORY 1.24337 respectively.                                                                                                                                    ############################## Xcleanspec History #############################                                                                                HISTORY This spectrum has been convolved with a Savitzky-Golay filter of        HISTORY width 4 pixels and degree 2.00000.                                      END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             